          "turns": [
            {
              "content": "先交提纲这件事怕我忘了，帮我记到待确认。",
              "createdAt": "2026-11-22T01:07:35.858Z",
              "id": "77f89e67-57bb-4ac6-9a17-0532ba173abf:user",
              "runId": "77f89e67-57bb-4ac6-9a17-0532ba173abf",
              "textSha256": "e3bd172c8b0c8f4b6d036d0cb7e865dcf055d9d36837207fde2730ae20fe56bb"
            },
            {
              "content": "他又把提纲改期了，原来那条改一下就行，不要多出来一份。",
              "createdAt": "2026-11-22T01:07:46.779Z",
              "id": "5909acdc-587b-47d4-9f7b-e0cb5754efea:user",
              "runId": "5909acdc-587b-47d4-9f7b-e0cb5754efea",
              "textSha256": "603ef8d2f00a91590bc32c9c42b1cca68ff8860adc4625d05295ba64dcf04c5e"
            },
            {
              "content": "那现在是不是还不用赶完整PPT？还有我和佳宁分别要做什么来着？",
              "createdAt": "2026-11-22T01:07:55.966Z",
              "id": "1df996d9-9b65-4f83-a4a1-1559d81c870b:user",
              "runId": "1df996d9-9b65-4f83-a4a1-1559d81c870b",
              "textSha256": "04490583799464a3456b207588fc0b476a5d02bb1c8e66c81605afde5c8819b4"
            },
            {
              "content": "以后给这位COMP5051周老师的回复，帮我记住：中文简短，先说结论，再列两三条需要他确认的问题；没做完的不能替我承诺已经完成。只对这个邮箱的周老师用，别套到别的老师。把这个偏好保存下来让我检查。",
              "createdAt": "2026-11-22T01:08:05.613Z",
              "id": "8d78f3f8-29d6-4133-a5ce-f6a1d622247a:user",
              "runId": "8d78f3f8-29d6-4133-a5ce-f6a1d622247a",
              "textSha256": "da2a701a31ec372a54efb5111e98df521066a0a6d8b502afef95623d84bd6b74"
            }
          ]
        },
